Package: bbsiaRadar
Title: Candidate discovery and corpus preparation for the BBSIA radar
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mancano Tales", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Collects public GitHub, Hugging Face, and GitLab.com metadata, prepares a citable
    Decifra corpus, and converts the radar codebook to the Decifra YAML contract.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports:
    dplyr (>= 1.1.0),
    digest,
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    purrr,
    readr,
    tibble,
    yaml
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
